{"success":true,"code":null,"message":null,"requestId":"T59e0c1fcd8d94118afd1096d481e46ba","data":{"contentData":{"id":"RAW_cc04d57a","displayDocument":"<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><img src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=6cde21e7&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FyuwWKyW2Jcya2TU4FI9v0YVn2Kuc4JJVAen20L2htvqBplASnR5bEJnRlnmv3VTHVXmy41Y8Vyv8RC3ZZQGeiaXQ59Zibn4aWrlNDKRiaHpbnA%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px !important;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>前言</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>Anthropic 最新随机对照实验发现，使用 AI 辅助编程的开发者虽然完成任务略快，但技能掌握程度比手写代码者低 17%。不过，主动向 AI 提问、寻求解释的使用方式，能有效缓解这一负面效应。如何在效率与成长之间找到平衡，是 AI 时代每位从业者必须面对的课题。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>今日前端早读课文章由 @Shen，@Judy Hanwen，@Tamkin，@Alex 分享，@飘飘编译。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>译文从这开始～～</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border-style:none;display:block;margin:0px auto 16px;max-width:100%;width:555px;height:555px;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=70733592&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_svg%2FQ3auHgzwzM6V4YDDibME74PyF2HqqZ1ApaDsGDTfqibWRg4CEdzoNu6G0lptiajjhyKyH9RKu2HjHTGfC099JTRjZDSzcZgxchmCxc5lM3JXCPTR2VM6APfEw%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dsvg%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>研究显示，AI 能帮助人们更快地完成工作中的部分任务。在一项基于 Claude.ai 数据的观察性研究中，我们发现 AI 可以将某些任务的速度提升高达 80%。然而，生产力的提高是否伴随着某些代价？其他研究表明，当人们借助 AI 工作时，他们对工作的投入程度会下降，主动思考的意愿也随之减弱 —— 换言之，他们将思维过程 \"外包\" 给了 AI。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span><a class=\"normal_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MTA1MjAxMQ==&amp;mid=2651279136&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0c7d1f5614ba41ba9adea0c6e6157cbf&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">【早说】不要将学习外包出去</a></span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>目前尚不清楚的是，这种 \"认知外包\" 是否会阻碍人们在工作中的技能成长，或者 —— 就编程而言 —— 是否会影响开发者对自己所构建系统的深入理解。我们最新的研究是一项以软件开发者为受试者的随机对照实验，旨在探究 AI 辅助工作可能带来的这一潜在隐患。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>这个问题的影响广泛而深远 —— 它关乎 AI 产品如何设计才能促进学习，关乎企业应当如何制定 AI 使用策略，也关乎更宏观层面的社会韧性等议题。我们选择聚焦编程领域，因为 AI 工具在这一领域已迅速成为标配。在这里，AI 制造了一种微妙的张力：随着编程日益自动化、工作效率不断提升，人类仍然需要具备发现错误、引导输出的能力，并在 AI 应用于高风险场景时承担最终的监督把关职责。AI 究竟是技能培养与效率提升的双赢捷径？还是说，AI 带来的生产力增长反而会侵蚀技能的养成？</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span><a class=\"normal_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MTA1MjAxMQ==&amp;mid=2651279085&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5d37952256d053f8cfd2ca80abfc9fb7&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">【第3698期】AI可观测性：大语言模型与智能体的全链路透视</a></span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>在这项随机对照实验中，我们考察了两个核心问题：一是软件开发者在有无 AI 辅助的情况下，学习一项新技能（具体为一个 Python 库）的速度有何差异；二是使用 AI 是否会导致他们对自己刚刚编写的代码缺乏真正的理解。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>结果显示，使用 AI 辅助导致了统计学上显著的技能掌握程度下降。在一项测试中 —— 考查的恰恰是受试者几分钟前刚刚使用过的概念 ——AI 组的得分比手写代码组低了 17%，相当于近两个等级的差距。AI 组在完成任务的速度上略有优势，但这一差异未达到统计学显著性水平。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>值得注意的是，使用 AI 辅助并不意味着一定会得低分。使用 AI 的方式决定了知识的留存程度。那些表现出更强掌握能力的受试者，不仅将 AI 当作代码生成工具，还在使用过程中主动构建理解 —— 他们会追问后续问题、要求 AI 解释原理，或者在独立编程的同时提出概念性问题。</span></p>\n  <h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:18px;line-height:1.25;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:24px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>实验设计</span></h4>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>我们招募了 52 名软件工程师（以初级开发者为主），每位受试者至少每周使用一次 Python，且有一年以上的使用经验。我们还确认了他们至少对 AI 编程辅助工具有一定了解，并且不熟悉 Trio—— 本实验所有任务所基于的 Python 库。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>实验分为三个阶段：热身练习；主任务 —— 使用 Trio 编写两个不同的功能模块（这要求理解异步编程的相关概念，而异步编程通常是在实际工作中逐步习得的技能）；以及一场测验。我们事先告知受试者测验环节的存在，但同时鼓励他们尽可能高效地完成任务。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>编程任务的设计模拟了开发者通过自学教程掌握新工具的真实场景。每位受试者会收到问题描述、初始代码框架，以及解题所需 Trio 概念的简要说明。实验使用在线编程平台，侧边栏内嵌了一个 AI 助手，该助手能够访问受试者的代码，且随时可以在被要求时直接生成正确的代码。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;border-style: none;display: block;margin: 0px auto 16px;max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=edb047de&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FyuwWKyW2JczJS6MrPEV14b43Bvxljf7OK6OD8zX5iadicaciaXk3ehucXYzAh0o6GoHl8tUNTwzcyrOl2UP3wrliavUJSIgb70tcW3kNCzHQufw%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:18px;line-height:1.25;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:24px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>评估设计</span></h4>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>在评估方案的设计上，我们借鉴了计算机科学教育领域的研究成果，确定了四类常用于考核编程技能掌握程度的题型：</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-weight: 600;\"><span>1、调试能力</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>识别和诊断代码错误的能力。这项技能对于发现 AI 生成代码中的错误、理解其失败原因至关重要。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-weight: 600;\"><span>2、代码阅读</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>阅读并理解代码功能的能力。这项技能使人类能够在部署之前审查和验证 AI 编写的代码。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-weight: 600;\"><span>3、代码编写</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>编写代码或选择正确编码方案的能力。随着 AI 编程工具的进一步普及，记住函数语法等底层编码能力的重要性将逐渐降低，而高层次的系统设计能力则愈发关键。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-weight: 600;\"><span>4、概念理解</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>掌握工具和代码库核心原理的能力。概念层面的理解对于判断 AI 生成的代码是否采用了恰当的软件设计模式、是否符合库的预期使用方式，具有决定性意义。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>我们的评估重点放在调试、代码阅读和概念理解三类题目上，因为我们认为这些能力对于监督日益普遍的 AI 生成代码最为重要。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span><a class=\"normal_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MTA1MjAxMQ==&amp;mid=2651279159&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=40f71ba2ace9c79fcf04a7a767999b3c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">【第3705期】让 Codex 物尽其用：从编程助手到全能工作系统</a></span></p>\n  <h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:18px;line-height:1.25;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:24px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>实验结果</span></h4>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>平均而言，AI 组的完成时间快了约两分钟，但这一差异在统计学上不显著。然而，测验成绩的差异却十分显著：AI 组的平均得分为 50%，而手写代码组为 67%—— 相当于近两个等级的差距（Cohen's d=0.738，p=0.01）。两组之间差距最大的是调试类题目，这表明：如果 AI 阻碍了编程能力的发展，那么识别代码错误及理解错误成因的能力，可能是尤其值得警惕的薄弱环节。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;border-style: none;display: block;margin: 0px auto 16px;max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=ae8882ef&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FyuwWKyW2Jcyr9cUyiaR2tRA6INug20PqYSqBDQMjyn2TScoX42LCXg3gPbuDteZibo2picL2ShqbRVV7aFAicYy4q5RtwVBicibCSplqyHI8mBqPQ%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dother%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p>\n  <h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:18px;line-height:1.25;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:24px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>定性分析：AI 交互模式</span></h4>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>我们特别关注受试者完成任务的具体方式。在定性分析中，我们对屏幕录像进行了人工标注，记录受试者花在撰写提问上的时间、提问的类型、犯错的类型，以及主动编码的时长。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>一个出乎意料的发现是，受试者与 AI 助手交互所耗费的时间之长超出预期。部分受试者仅在撰写提问上就花了多达 11 分钟（占总时长的 30%），提问次数最多达 15 次。这也解释了为什么 AI 组虽然平均完成速度更快，但生产力的提升并未达到统计学显著水平。我们推测，AI 在用于重复性或熟悉的任务时，更有可能带来显著的效率提升。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>不出所料，无 AI 组遇到了更多错误，既包括语法错误，也包括 Trio 概念方面的错误 —— 而后者恰恰与测验中的考查内容直接对应。我们的假设是：那些遇到更多 Trio 相关错误的受试者（即对照组），很可能通过独立解决这些错误，切实提升了自身的调试能力。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>随后，我们根据受试者与 AI 的交互方式进行了分组，识别出若干不同的行为模式，这些模式在完成时间和学习效果上呈现出截然不同的结果。</span></p>\n  <h5 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:1.25;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:24px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>低分交互模式</span></h5>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>低分模式的共同特征是高度依赖 AI，无论是用于代码生成还是调试。该类群体的平均测验得分不足 40%。他们表现出较少的独立思考和较多的认知外包。具体可细分为：</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-weight: 600;\"><span>1、全权委托型</span></strong><span>（n=4）</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>这组受试者完全依赖 AI 编写代码和完成任务。他们完成速度最快，过程中几乎没有遇到错误。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-weight: 600;\"><span>2、渐进依赖型</span></strong><span>（n=4）</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>这组受试者起初只问一两个问题，但最终将所有代码编写工作交给了 AI 助手。他们测验得分较低，主要原因在于对第二个任务中的概念几乎毫无掌握。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-weight: 600;\"><span>3、迭代调试型</span></strong><span>（n=4）</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>这组受试者依赖 AI 来调试或验证代码。他们提问更多，但目的是让 AI 替他们解决问题，而非厘清自己的理解。因此，他们不仅得分较低，完成两项任务的速度也更慢。</span></p>\n  <h5 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:1.25;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:24px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>高分交互模式</span></h5>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>我们将平均测验得分达到 65% 及以上的交互模式归为高分模式。这些受试者既利用 AI 生成代码，也向 AI 提出概念性问题。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-weight: 600;\"><span>1、先生成后理解型</span></strong><span>（n=2）</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>这组受试者先让 AI 生成代码，再手动将代码复制粘贴到自己的工作区。代码生成之后，他们会向 AI 助手追问后续问题，以加深理解。这些受试者使用 AI 时速度并不算快，但在测验中展现出更高的理解水平。有趣的是，这种模式在外观上与 \"全权委托型\" 几乎如出一辙，唯一的区别在于他们还借助 AI 来检验自己的理解。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-weight: 600;\"><span>2、代码与解释混合型</span></strong><span>（n=3）</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>这组受试者在提问时将代码生成与解释请求合二为一，既要求 AI 写出代码，也要求 AI 阐释代码的逻辑。阅读和消化这些解释需要更多时间，但有效促进了他们的理解。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-weight: 600;\"><span>3、概念探究型</span></strong><span>（n=7）</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>这组受试者只提出概念性问题，然后凭借加深的理解独立完成任务。尽管这组受试者遇到了大量错误，但他们也都独立解决了这些错误。在所有高分模式中，这种方式平均速度最快，在全部模式中排名第二，仅次于 \"全权委托型\"。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>我们的定性分析并不能在交互模式与学习效果之间建立因果关系，但确实揭示了与不同学习结果相关联的行为特征。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span><a class=\"normal_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MTA1MjAxMQ==&amp;mid=2651278368&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2fc907be01c3b32ada38b3fa9a4d2108&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\">【第3638期】从 DevTools 到智能性能代理：用 AI 重塑前端性能分析的新方式</a></span></p>\n  <h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:18px;line-height:1.25;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:24px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>结论</span></h4>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>我们的研究结果表明，在工作场景中大举引入 AI—— 尤其是在软件工程领域 —— 需要权衡利弊。研究发现揭示了一个关键事实：并非所有对 AI 的依赖都是一回事。我们在追求效率的过程中与 AI 互动的方式，深刻影响着我们能从中学到多少。面对时间压力和组织绩效要求，初级开发者或其他专业人员很可能会依赖 AI 尽快完成任务，却以牺牲技能成长为代价 —— 尤其是在出现问题时排查调试的能力。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>尽管这些结果尚属初步发现，但在企业逐步迈向 AI 编写代码占比越来越高的时代，它们提出了不容忽视的警示。如果初级工程师的技能成长从一开始就因使用 AI 而受阻，那么生产力的提升可能是以丧失验证 AI 代码所必需的能力为代价的。管理者应当审慎思考如何大规模部署 AI 工具，并考虑建立相应的机制或进行有意识的产品设计，确保工程师在工作中持续学习成长 —— 从而能够对自己构建的系统实施真正有意义的监督。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>对于软件工程或其他行业的新手从业者而言，我们的研究可以视为一份支持 \"有意识地借助 AI 工具进行技能修炼\" 的小小证据。认知上的努力 —— 甚至是那种令人抓耳挠腮、寸步难行的痛苦 —— 对于精通一项技能很可能是不可或缺的。这一启示同样适用于个人选择如何与 AI 协作，以及选择使用哪些工具。主流大语言模型服务也已推出学习模式（例如 Claude Code 的学习与解释模式，或 ChatGPT 的学习模式），旨在促进深层理解。了解人们在使用 AI 时如何学习，也有助于指导我们如何设计 AI；AI 辅助应当让人类在提高工作效率的同时，也能不断习得新的技能。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>此前的研究对于 AI 究竟促进还是阻碍编程生产力，得出了不一致的结论。我们自己的研究曾发现，AI 可以将某些工作任务的完成时间缩短 80%—— 这一结果似乎与本文的发现相矛盾。但两项研究探讨的是不同的问题，采用的也是不同的方法：此前的观察性研究衡量的是受试者已经具备相关技能时的生产力表现，而本研究考察的则是人们在学习新事物时会发生什么。AI 有可能在已有技能的运用上加速生产力，同时却阻碍新技能的习得，不过要深入理解这一关系，还需要更多的研究。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>本研究仅仅是揭示人机协作如何影响劳动者工作体验的第一步。我们的样本量相对较小，评估测量的是编程任务完成后不久的即时理解水平。即时测验表现能否预测长期的技能发展，是本研究尚未解答的一个重要问题。还有许多悬而未决的问题有待未来的研究去探索，例如 AI 对编程以外任务的影响、这一效应是否会随着工程师能力的提升而逐渐消退，以及 AI 辅助与人类辅助在学习过程中是否存在差异。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>归根结底，要在 AI 时代兼顾技能发展，我们需要以更宏观的视角审视 AI 对劳动者的影响。在 AI 赋能的职场中，生产力的提升固然重要，但支撑这些效率提升的专业能力之长远发展，同样不可偏废。</span></p>\n  <h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:18px;line-height:1.25;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:24px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>启示</span></h4>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>对企业：企业盲目追求短期效率而全面推行 AI，可能会导致初级员工的技能发育 “停滞”，未来将缺乏对 AI 生成代码进行审核和纠错的高级人才。管理者需要设计合理的机制确保员工在工作中保持学习。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:16px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span>对个人：在面对新技术时，“感到痛苦” 和 “卡壳” 恰恰是认知和技能形成的必经之路。不管是使用 Claude 的 “代码学习与解释模式” 还是 ChatGPT 的 “学习模式”，都应当主动把 AI 当成导师，而不是代笔大侠。</span></p>\n  <p class=\"channels_iframe_wrp\"></p>\n  <div></div>\n  <p></p>\n  <p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;font-size:16px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;margin-top:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, Optima, PingFangSC-light, PingFangTC-light, PingFang SC, Cambria, Cochin, Georgia, Times, Times New Roman, serif;margin-bottom:0px !important;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;text-align:start;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">关于本文</span></span><span> \n    <br> \n   </span><span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">译者：@飘飘</span></span><span> \n    <br> \n   </span><span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">作者：@Shen, Judy Hanwen and Tamkin, Alex</span></span><span> \n    <br> \n   </span><span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">原文：<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/research/AI-assistance-coding-skills\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.anthropic.com/research/AI-assistance-coding-skills</a></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"></p>\n </body>\n</html>","edited":true,"updateTime":"2026-05-27T22:33:06.633+00:00"}}}